/* 승강기 비교 리포트: 기존 사이트의 카드 디자인과 조화되는 독립 스타일 */
.spotlight-wrap {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: -28px;
    z-index: 2
}

.spotlight {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 22px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #deebe3;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px #071d1719;
    padding: 25px 30px;
    border-radius: 20px
}

.spotlight-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px
}

.spotlight-icon {
    width: 62px;
    height: 62px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: #e7f4eb;
    color: #20694e;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-size: 28px
}

.spotlight-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #21765a;
    font-weight: 850;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1px
}

.spotlight h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -.65px;
    margin: 6px 0
}

.spotlight p {
    color: #73857b;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0
}

.spotlight-arrow {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 39px;
    height: 39px;
    background: #e8f5ee;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #287257;
    font-size: 22px
}

.spotlight:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 20px 45px #071d1728
}

.elevator-report {
    margin-top: 22px
}

.report-hero {
    color: #fff;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, #2e725b 0%, transparent 43%), linear-gradient(125deg, #123c36, #102a36);
    padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 42px);
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden
}

.report-eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: #a6e1c7;
    font-weight: 800
}

.report-hero h2 {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    margin: 16px 0
}

.report-hero h2 span {
    color: #a9eed0
}

.report-hero p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #d3e1dc;
    line-height: 1.9;
    max-width: 630px
}

.report-hero-strip {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 28px
}

.report-hero-strip span {
    border: 1px solid #ffffff43;
    background: #ffffff12;
    border-radius: 30px;
    padding: 9px 13px;
    font-size: 12px
}

.report-hero-strip b {
    color: #b6f6d3;
    margin-left: 4px
}

.report-stat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 11px;
    margin: 16px 0 48px
}

.report-stat {
    background: #f2f7f3;
    border: 1px solid #e0ece2;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 19px 15px;
    min-width: 0
}

.report-stat small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #688375;
    font-weight: 750
}

.report-stat>b {
    display: block;
    margin: 10px 0 8px;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.7vw, 31px);
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: #184e3b
}

.report-stat b em {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 750;
    margin-left: 3px
}

.report-stat .stat-text {
    font-size: 25px
}

.report-stat>span {
    color: #6e8879;
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    display: block
}

.report-stat-feature {
    background: #184e3b
}

.report-stat-feature small,
.report-stat-feature>b,
.report-stat-feature span {
    color: white
}

.report-section {
    margin: 48px 0
}

.report-section-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 22px
}

.report-no {
    background: #e7f4ed;
    color: #287b58;
    font-weight: 850;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 9px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    flex-shrink: 0
}

.report-section-head h3 {
    font-size: clamp(19px, 2.6vw, 25px);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: -.7px;
    color: #1b3832
}

.report-section-head p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #819085;
    margin: 0
}

.report-highlight {
    background: #edf6f0;
    border-left: 4px solid #319b73;
    padding: 16px 19px;
    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #597866;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 18px
}

.report-highlight strong {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: #244c38
}

.report-highlight em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: #16875e
}

.raw-chart {
    background: #f9fbfa;
    border: 1px solid #e7eee9;
    padding: 19px;
    border-radius: 14px
}

.report-bar-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 164px 1fr 83px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 11px;
    min-height: 29px;
    margin: 5px 0;
    font-size: 11px
}

.report-bar-label {
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    color: #5c7366
}

.report-bar-track {
    background: #e6eeea;
    border-radius: 4px;
    height: 10px;
    overflow: hidden
}

.report-bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    background: #a1bdb0;
    border-radius: 4px
}

.report-bar-value {
    text-align: right;
    color: #527766;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-weight: 780;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums
}

.report-bar-value small {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-left: 2px
}

.report-bar-ours {
    margin: 9px -9px;
    padding: 7px 9px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #e5f4ec
}

.report-bar-ours .report-bar-label,
.report-bar-ours .report-bar-value {
    font-weight: 850;
    color: #096b45
}

.report-bar-ours .report-bar-fill {
    background: #149468
}

.report-fine {
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #778b80;
    margin: 13px 0
}

.report-fine strong {
    color: #5b7566
}

.report-fine a {
    color: #1b7959;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px
}

.report-soft {
    background: #f7faf8;
    border: 1px solid #e7eee9;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 25px
}

.report-story-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 13px
}

.report-story {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e4ede6;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px
}

.story-mark {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #e1f1e8;
    color: #19704e;
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 900
}

.report-story h4 {
    margin: 17px 0 7px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #214a3a
}

.report-story p {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #6c7c72;
    margin: 0
}

.report-subtitle {
    margin: 27px 0 11px;
    font-size: 17px
}

.report-warning {
    background: #fff7e9;
    border: 1px solid #f0ddbb;
    padding: 15px 17px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #886a3e
}

.report-warning strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
    color: #815520;
    font-size: 13px
}

.normalized-chart {
    border: 1px solid #e2ebe4;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 13px;
    padding: 19px;
    margin-top: 14px
}

.norm-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 138px 1fr 108px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 13px;
    min-height: 65px;
    padding: 7px 5px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e6eee8
}

.norm-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none
}

.norm-label strong,
.norm-label small,
.norm-value strong,
.norm-value small {
    display: block
}

.norm-label strong {
    color: #41614f;
    font-size: 12px
}

.norm-label small {
    color: #91a198;
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-top: 4px
}

.norm-track {
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #edf3ed;
    overflow: hidden
}

.norm-track>span {
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    background: #a1bcaf;
    border-radius: 4px
}

.norm-value {
    text-align: right
}

.norm-value strong {
    color: #47735d;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums
}

.norm-value strong small {
    display: inline;
    font-size: 10px;
    margin-left: 2px
}

.norm-value>small {
    color: #83978a;
    font-size: 10px;
    margin-top: 3px
}

.norm-ours {
    background: #ebf7ef;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding-left: 8px;
    padding-right: 8px
}

.norm-ours .norm-track span {
    background: #24946c
}

.norm-ours .norm-label strong,
.norm-ours .norm-value strong {
    color: #116e4a
}

.timeline {
    border-left: 2px solid #cce5d4;
    margin: 22px 0 22px 13px
}

.timeline-item {
    padding: 0 0 23px 22px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 112px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    position: relative
}

.timeline-item:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0
}

.timeline-item:before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -8px;
    top: 3px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #bad9c8;
    border: 2px solid white;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #cce5d4
}

.timeline-item.current:before {
    background: #199169
}

.timeline-item>span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #277953;
    font-weight: 800
}

.timeline-item strong {
    font-size: 14px
}

.timeline-item p {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #75877a;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 6px 0 0
}

.report-details {
    background: #f6f9f6;
    border: 1px solid #e1eae3;
    border-radius: 13px;
    overflow: hidden
}

.report-details>summary {
    padding: 17px 21px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 780;
    color: #296046;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between
}

.report-details summary::marker {
    content: ''
}

.report-details>summary span {
    font-size: 19px
}

.report-details[open]>summary span {
    transform: rotate(180deg)
}

.table-scroller {
    overflow-x: auto;
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: 0 15px
}

.report-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    min-width: 760px;
    font-size: 11px
}

.report-table th,
.report-table td {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e1ebe4;
    padding: 11px 8px;
    text-align: left;
    white-space: nowrap
}

.report-table thead th {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #6a806e;
    background: #e6efe9
}

.report-table tbody th {
    font-weight: 670
}

.report-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
    background: #fff
}

.report-table tbody tr.our-row {
    background: #dff3e7;
    font-weight: 850;
    color: #0b734d
}

.report-table .align-num {
    text-align: right;
    font-weight: 800
}

.row-tag {
    font-size: 9px;
    color: #fff;
    background: #167e58;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 3px 5px;
    margin-left: 4px
}

.report-details>.report-fine {
    padding: 0 20px 14px
}

.report-ending {
    background: #e8f3ed;
    border-radius: 13px;
    padding: 25px;
    margin-top: 45px
}

.report-ending b {
    display: block;
    color: #20563d;
    font-size: 19px
}

.report-ending p {
    color: #597866;
    line-height: 1.85;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 10px 0 0
}

@media(max-width:800px) {
    .report-stat-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 10px
    }

    .report-bar-row {
        grid-template-columns: 125px 1fr 75px;
        gap: 7px
    }

    .report-bar-label {
        font-size: 10px
    }

    .norm-row {
        grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr 98px;
        gap: 7px
    }
}

@media(max-width:550px) {
    .spotlight {
        padding: 16px 15px;
        gap: 10px
    }

    .spotlight-left {
        gap: 11px
    }

    .spotlight-icon {
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        font-size: 21px;
        border-radius: 10px
    }

    .spotlight h2 {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.5
    }

    .spotlight p {
        font-size: 10px
    }

    .spotlight-arrow {
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        font-size: 17px
    }

    .spotlight-tag {
        font-size: 9px
    }

    .report-hero {
        padding: 23px 17px
    }

    .report-hero p {
        font-size: 12px
    }

    .report-hero-strip {
        gap: 7px
    }

    .report-hero-strip span {
        font-size: 10px;
        padding: 7px 9px
    }

    .report-stat-grid {
        margin-bottom: 35px
    }

    .report-stat {
        padding: 15px 11px
    }

    .report-stat>b {
        font-size: 23px
    }

    .report-stat b em {
        font-size: 10px
    }

    .report-stat .stat-text {
        font-size: 22px
    }

    .report-section {
        margin: 34px 0
    }

    .report-section-head {
        gap: 8px
    }

    .report-section-head h3 {
        font-size: 19px
    }

    .report-highlight {
        font-size: 12px
    }

    .report-highlight strong {
        font-size: 14px
    }

    .raw-chart {
        padding: 8px
    }

    .report-bar-row {
        grid-template-columns: 95px 1fr 67px;
        gap: 5px;
        font-size: 10px;
        min-height: 27px
    }

    .report-bar-label {
        font-size: 9px
    }

    .report-bar-value {
        font-size: 10px
    }

    .report-bar-value small {
        font-size: 8px
    }

    .report-bar-track {
        height: 9px
    }

    .report-soft {
        padding: 17px 12px
    }

    .report-story-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr
    }

    .report-story {
        padding: 17px
    }

    .normalized-chart {
        padding: 8px
    }

    .norm-row {
        grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr 75px;
        gap: 6px;
        min-height: 62px
    }

    .norm-label strong {
        font-size: 11px
    }

    .norm-label small {
        font-size: 9px
    }

    .norm-value strong {
        font-size: 12px
    }

    .norm-value strong small {
        font-size: 8px
    }

    .norm-value>small {
        font-size: 9px
    }

    .timeline-item {
        grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr;
        gap: 8px;
        padding-left: 16px
    }

    .timeline-item>span {
        font-size: 10px
    }

    .timeline-item strong {
        font-size: 12px
    }

    .report-ending {
        padding: 19px
    }

    .report-ending b {
        font-size: 16px
    }
}

@media print {

    .topbar,
    .footer,
    .back-link,
    .spotlight-wrap,
    .lightbox {
        display: none !important
    }

    .article {
        border: none !important;
        padding: 0 !important
    }

    .report-details {
        break-inside: avoid
    }

    .report-details:not([open]) .table-scroller {
        display: block !important
    }

    .report-hero,
    .report-stat-feature {
        print-color-adjust: exact
    }
}

.report-chart-legend {
    display: flex;
    gap: 13px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 12px 0;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #647c6c
}

.report-chart-legend span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px
}

.report-chart-legend i {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 3px
}

.legend-before,
.report-bar-before .report-bar-fill {
    background: #d7ac76
}

.legend-ours {
    background: #149468
}

.legend-other {
    background: #a1bdb0
}

.before-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 9px;
    color: #a67d4b;
    margin-top: 3px
}